{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1086949-alchemy","id":1086949,"title":"Alchemy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-02T19:24:12-07:00","id":1086949,"title":"Alchemy","content":"I'm starting a new one-on-one Mage Chronicle and my player is very interested in Alchemy with a chemistry flavor as opposed to the more traditional metal oriented alchemy. He would like to develop a Legacy for this as well. Can any of you help me with developing this for him?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T19:48:56-07:00","id":1086960,"title":"","content":"As in he wants to found one? Or have already joined one?<br /> If it's the fomer, I'd work with him on making one as opposed to making it for him.<br /> If the latter, then I'd suggest perhaps an Obrimos/Mysterium founded Matter Legacy.<br /> Focused around applying the Obrimos &quot;hidden laws&quot; principle to the properties of physical matter.<br /> Secondary Arcanum likely Prime, if only because that would make advanced Legacy members adept at Imbued items.<br /> Especially important given Dave's indiciation that Signs of Sorcery will have easier to craft imbued items that operate on charges, much more like classic potions.<br /> <br /> In terms of Attainments, I'd suggest going with ones that modify the physical properties of matter. There's a LOT of flexibility there.<br /> Perhaps the 3rd Attainment is a scene-long ritual which modifies a specific property, such as making it water-soluble, ductile, or making it react explosively with oxygen.<br /> The 4th Attainment would probably be amiss if it weren't Transubstantitation. Allowing you to turn wood into gold, without worrying about spell control and relinquishment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T20:21:13-07:00","id":1086971,"title":"","content":"Ok. The Legacy will be his Obssession? He is trying to create the Legacy or join one?<br /> What is the kind of things he wants to do? Healing elixirs? Potions to turn one thing into another?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T06:27:59-07:00","id":1087132,"title":"","content":"I'd use Detect Substance as the first attainment with dice penalties put into Potency so that at Matter 5 you could pick up to 7 discrete substances at a time. I think I'd make the Reach be used on Instant Activation but let it run for a Duration=Concentration so you can walk around a room and find what you're looking for when you get close.<br /> <br /> A second attainment in Matter could be based on a Knowing effect to tell you what chemical reactions you'd get from mixing selected substances. Eventually getting up to fantasy substances.<br /> <br /> Haven't had ideas for the Optional arcana, maybe Life so you could also determine and choose people's biological reactions to your creations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T07:20:22-07:00","id":1087142,"title":"","content":"The character was originally made as a Moros - Death 1, Matter 3, Prime 2 if that helps. He could change Prime if it made sense to do so.<br /> <br /> He seems to be mainly interested in Chemistry more than metal working and forging. What sort of Obessions and Mysteries do you think a character like this might be trying to pursue?<br /> <br /> He has a Rank 2 Ghost familiar that he met in his job as a chemistry lab assistant at Cambridge University. It's the Ghost of a murdered (cause and perpetrator unknown) graduate student from the Geology department. Pursuing this Mystery caused his Awakening.<br /> <br /> Other things: He was assigned to a cabal and while he was out of town they attempted a ritual and were wiped out via excessive Paradox. He is doing research for the Brotherhood of Ineffable Truth to help them find the Saphire Bloodstone of Irem (whatever that is, I made it up) in return for Hallow privileges until he gets back on his feet.<br /> <br /> Thanks everyone, for helping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1470,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","user":"Johnny Awesome","date":". 05-03-2017, 10:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T08:16:52-07:00","id":1087169,"title":"","content":"He can have Obssessions with the Elixir of Eternal Youth, the Universal Panacea, etc. It depends on what kind of chemestry he wants to do (explosives, remedies, fuel). He has a good array of choices. Maybe he can attempt to create the Saphire Bloodstone of Irem, in his research he discovers the formula and it is similar to the Philosopher stone formula (Full metal alchemist). He can try offering animals as a sacrament, but the only way to create a permanent one is with human lives... perharps because of souls that animals lack.<br /> <br /> If you're not looking for creepy things, maybe he can help with the creating or discovery of the stone by making a catalyst that enhances one Saphire of Irem into the Saphire Bloodstone of Irem.<br /> <br /> Now for the Legacy.<br /> I would suggest these powers:<br /> Matter / Prime<br /> 1st: Discern Composition. Reach for Instant Activation<br /> Optional: Something like Supernal Vision to detect the supernatural energies of something (mana and stuff). Reach for Instant Activation<br /> <br /> 2nd: Detect Substance for finding stuff. Reach for Instant Activation and Advanced Duration<br /> Optional: Supernal Veil, so he can carry stuff around that is not detected by P. Mage Sight. Scene for the ritual, reach for Advanced Duration<br /> <br /> 3rd: Alchemist Touch. Being immune to damage caused by your playthings is a good thing. Reach for Instant Activation and Advanced Duration.<br /> Optional: I would put Stealing Fire here. He can make a Potion so strong that causes an Sleeper to become a Sleepwalker for a period. Scene for making the potion, Reach for Advanced Duration. But if he does not want things like that, a perfecting Prime effect to enhance the Truth of his supernatural potions would be cool as well.<br /> <br /> 4th and 5th attainments are so far away from players(normally) that I didn't came up with them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T11:50:09-07:00","id":1087257,"title":"","content":"Fantastic stuff.<br /> <br /> Any suggestions on what the Saphire Bloodstone might do or enable?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T11:59:51-07:00","id":1087268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Johnny Awesome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1086949-alchemy?p=1087257#post1087257\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fantastic stuff.<br /> <br /> Any suggestions on what the Saphire Bloodstone might do or enable?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on what your plots and researches suggest it does.<br /> It can be anything from being a cute chunk of supernal truth to being able to turn coal into gold and get the dead back alive with souls.<br /> It can be a key for a Soul Eyes (p. 243) or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}